OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant worker attacked by
OL,4,A'dine-and-dash' customer who left #30
OL,5,Abill
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Chinese restaurant worker has
OL,8,Fdescribed the moment she was attacked
OL,9,Fby a "dine-and-dash" customer who fled
OL,10,Fafter leaving without paying a #30
OL,11,Fbill.
OL,13,FNoodle Alley on Faulkner Street in
OL,14,FManchester city centre posted CCTV
OL,15,Ffootage on Facebook of the period
OL,16,Fleading up to the incident, which saw
OL,17,Fthe 28-year-old female staff member
OL,18,Fthrown to the floor.
OL,20,FIt shows three people leaving the
OL,21,Frestaurant and the staff member
OL,22,Finitially chasing after them.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
