OL,6,
OL,7,FThe woman, who has asked to remain
OL,8,Fanonymous, said she was "pushed to the
OL,9,Fground" when she tried to confront one
OL,10,Fof the group and was left in tears with
OL,11,Fbruises on her right arm.
